values ('AU:animal-science-technician','2026-05-01',null,null,null,null,1852,null,null,null,null,74,'2026-05-01',-14.29,3.21,8.73,0,0,5,0,13,0,5,5,5,33,'career-opportunity-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','No exact current OSCA Animal Science Technician title exists. OSCA 311132 Animal Husbandry Technician is the closest non-clinical technical occupation because it covers livestock breeding, nutrition, health and welfare monitoring, technical procedures and research data collection.','clinical_exclusion','OSCA 269532 Veterinary Technologist, alternative title Animal Technician, is centred on diagnostic and clinical animal care and is not used as the primary mapping.','labour_scope','The current ingest has no six-digit ANZSCO 311113 labour profile, so primary employment, demographics and earnings remain null.','broader_3111_context',jsonb_build_object('employment_total',2800,'part_time_share_pct',19,'female_share_pct',32,'median_age',33,'average_full_time_hours',41,'median_weekly_earnings_aud',1808,'median_hourly_earnings_aud',47,'scope','ANZSCO 3111 Agricultural Technicians context only'),'vacancy_scope','Broader ANZSCO 3111 vacancies were 74 in May 2026 versus 86.33333 in May 2025, about -14.29% year on year; no exact intensity or trend credit.','projection_scope','Broader ANZSCO 3111 projections are +3.21% to 2030 and +8.73% to 2035; partial growth credit only.','shortage_note','JSA 2025 OSL records current OSCA 311132 Animal Husbandry Technician as No Shortage nationally.','visa_basis','The current skilled occupation instrument includes ANZSCO 311113 Animal Husbandry Technician with VETASSESS. VETASSESS classifies it as Group C, but canonical Animal Science Technician is a related title rather than an exact Australian occupation, so partial visa credit is used.','entry_level_basis','Charles Sturt Bachelor of Animal Science 068972G is a current four-year animal-science route; UQ Bachelor of Veterinary Technology 087886D is a current three-year related technology route with animal husbandry, breeding and nutrition content.','score_note','Primary labour metrics remain null because the canonical title is related rather than exact; broader demand data and migration evidence are explicitly scoped.'),'2026-08-09')
